# Supabase cloud-sync configuration (optional — omit for local-only progress).
# Get these from your Supabase project: Settings → API.
# The anon key is a PUBLIC/publishable key — safe to expose in the client
# bundle; row-level security protects your data. Do NOT use the service_role key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
